    <string name="action_setup_help">How do I enable this on my watch?</string>
    <string name="prepare_instructions">On the watch: Settings › Developer options › turn on <b>ADB debugging</b>, then turn on <b>Wireless debugging</b>. Tap <b>Pair new device</b> and note the IP address, port and 6-digit code.\n\nThe watch and this phone must be on the same Wi-Fi network, and the watch screen must stay awake while pairing. The pairing port and the connection port are different, and both change every time Wireless debugging is toggled.</string>

